From: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: soc: rockchip: Add the board's sleep configuration node

Rockchip's BL31 takes a board's sleep mode, wake sources and
PWM-driven regulators from the kernel. Describe the node that holds
them: rockchip,sleep-mode-config, rockchip,wakeup-config and
rockchip,pwm-regulator-config, each a mask of the firmware's flags.

Signed-off-by: Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/rockchip/rockchip,pm-config.yaml | 44 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 44 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/rockchip/rockchip,pm-config.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/rockchip/rockchip,pm-config.yaml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..b6cdf2a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/rockchip/rockchip,pm-config.yaml
@@ -0,0 +1,44 @@
+# SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0-only OR BSD-2-Clause)
+%YAML 1.2
+---
+$id: http://devicetree.org/schemas/soc/rockchip/rockchip,pm-config.yaml#
+$schema: http://devicetree.org/meta-schemas/core.yaml#
+
+title: Rockchip suspend firmware configuration
+
+maintainers:
+  - Artem Butusov <art.sormy@gmail.com>
+
+description:
+  The board's sleep mode, wake sources and PWM-driven regulators, handed to
+  Rockchip's suspend firmware (BL31) at boot. Each value is a mask of the
+  firmware's RKPM_* flags.
+
+properties:
+  compatible:
+    const: rockchip,pm-rk3528
+
+  rockchip,sleep-mode-config:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32
+    description: What deep suspend powers down.
+
+  rockchip,wakeup-config:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32
+    description: The interrupts that wake it.
+
+  rockchip,pwm-regulator-config:
+    $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/uint32
+    description: The PWM outputs that drive a regulator the firmware keeps.
+
+required:
+  - compatible
+
+additionalProperties: false
+
+examples:
+  - |
+    power-management {
+        compatible = "rockchip,pm-rk3528";
+        rockchip,sleep-mode-config = <0x2>;
+        rockchip,wakeup-config = <0x11>;
+    };
